.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt XFTP-SERVER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm xftp-server
.Nd SimpleX File Transfer Protocol server
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm init
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl p Ar port
.Op Fl q Ar quota
.Op Fl -sign-algorithm Ar alg
.Op Fl -path Ar dir
.Op Ar host
.Nm
.Cm start
.Op Fl l
.Nm
.Cm delete
.Nm
.Cm help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a file transfer server implementing the XFTP protocol.
It handles end-to-end encrypted file uploads and downloads,
and does not store unencrypted file content or user
identifiers.
.Pp
The server must be initialized once before first use.
The
.Cm init
command creates configuration files, TLS credentials, and
the file store directory.
The
.Cm start
command runs the server in the foreground.
.Pp
On LibreSSL systems, the
.Fl -sign-algorithm Ar alg
option must be set to
.Ar ED25519
because LibreSSL does not provide the ED448 algorithm.
.Pp
The
.Fl p Ar port
option overrides the default port 443.
The
.Fl -path Ar dir
option sets the file storage directory
(default:
.Pa /var/simplex/xftp-server/files ) .
The
.Fl q Ar quota
option sets the total storage quota in bytes.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/simplex/xftp-server/
Configuration files and TLS credentials.
.It Pa /var/simplex/xftp-server/
File store, persistent state, and logs.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr simplex-chat 1 ,
.Xr smp-server 1
.Sh STANDARDS
.Rs
.%T XFTP Protocol
.%U https://github.com/simplex-chat/simplexmq/blob/stable/protocol/xftp.md
.Re
.Sh AUTHORS
.An SimpleX Chat contributors
